msgid ""
"**Screenshot**, **Screenshot to Clipboard**, **Record Video**, **Record "
"Sound to WAV...**, **Record...** (RZX), **RZX Player**"
msgstr ""
"**Screenshot**, **Screenshot to Clipboard**, **Record Video**, **Record "
"Sound to WAV...**, **Record...** (RZX), **RZX Player**"

msgid "[Machine menu](machines.md)"
msgstr "[Меню Machine](machines.md)"

msgid "**Model**, **Reset**, **NMI**, **Turbo Mode**"
msgstr "**Model**, **Reset**, **NMI**, **Turbo Mode**"

msgid "[Speed and time](time.md)"
msgstr "[Швидкість і час](time.md)"

msgid "**Pause**, **Fast Mode**, **Fast Forward**, **Slow Motion**, **Rewind**"
msgstr "**Pause**, **Fast Mode**, **Fast Forward**, **Slow Motion**, **Rewind**"

msgid "[Media menu](media.md)"
msgstr "[Меню Media](media.md)"

msgid ""
"**Tape Play/Stop**, **Tape Record/Stop**, **Tape Player**, **Disk "
"Manager**, **Cartridge**, **divMMC**, **SD Card**, **Drives**"
msgstr ""
"**Tape Play/Stop**, **Tape Record/Stop**, **Tape Player**, **Disk "
"Manager**, **Cartridge**, **divMMC**, **SD Card**, **Drives**"

msgid "[View menu](view.md)"
msgstr "[Меню View](view.md)"

msgid ""
"**Fullscreen**, **Keep Aspect Ratio**, **Size**, **Shaders**, **ZX "
"Palette**, **Virtual Keyboard**"
msgstr ""
"**Fullscreen**, **Keep Aspect Ratio**, **Size**, **Shaders**, **ZX "
"Palette**, **Virtual Keyboard**"

msgid "[Input menu](input.md)"
msgstr "[Меню Input](input.md)"

msgid "**Grab Keyboard**, **Grab Mouse**, **Keymap**, **Gamepads**"
msgstr "**Grab Keyboard**, **Grab Mouse**, **Keymap**, **Gamepads**"

msgid "[Tools menu](tools.md)"
msgstr "[Меню Tools](tools.md)"

msgid ""
"**Cheats...**, **Debugger**, **Screen**, **Sound Chips**, **Heat Map**, "
"**Options...**"
msgstr ""
"**Cheats...**, **Debugger**, **Screen**, **Sound Chips**, **Heat Map**, "
"**Options...**"

msgid "[Mute](machines.md#mute)"
msgstr "[Mute](machines.md#mute)"

msgid "**Mute**"
msgstr "**Mute**"

msgid ""
"A button for a menu - **Model**, **Turbo Mode**, **Size** and the like - "
"opens that menu when clicked. A button with an arrow beside it does its "
"command when clicked, and the arrow opens its menu: **Reset** lists the "
"ROMs, **Disk Manager** the drives, **divMMC** the cards, **Gamepads** the"
" joysticks, **Debugger** its windows, **Mute** the volume slider."
msgstr ""
"Кнопка меню — **Model**, **Turbo Mode**, **Size** і подібні — за "
"клацанням відкриває це меню. Кнопка зі стрілкою поруч за клацанням "
"виконує свою команду, а стрілка відкриває її меню: **Reset** — список "
"ROM, **Disk Manager** — дисководи, **divMMC** — картки, **Gamepads** — "
"джойстики, **Debugger** — свої вікна, **Mute** — повзунок гучності."

msgid ""
"**Rewind** has no menu item: it works while the button or its key is held"
" down. The time buttons work as their keys do; see [How the keys "
"work](time.md#how-the-keys-work)."
msgstr ""
"**Rewind** не має пункту меню: перемотування триває, поки кнопку або її "
"клавішу утримують. Кнопки часу працюють так само, як їхні клавіші; див. "
"[Як працюють клавіші](time.md#how-the-keys-work)."

